  "details": "The existing in game keyboard is pretty lacking.\n\nFor example, this may not seem like a big deal, but simply the fact that when I hit shift, it does not automatically revert to lowercase after I have hit the corresponding key, is pretty egregious. very annoying, as it requires extra steps, which leads to the next issue, which is how terribly slow it is to register. I can type with the laser pointer fairly quickly. but the detection is so bad that it will miss every other letter. if I were to type out \"Hello World\" at my usual speed, i'd be lucky to end up with \"Hlo wrd\"\n\nit generally isnt such an issue in most cases because the biggest use is searching simple words. But I do notice it. and it is ESPECIALLY bad at the log in screen. \n\nMaybe time for sprucing it up?",
